<b><div align="center">APPENDIX A</div></b>

<br>
<b>Persons Participating in the Investigation</b>
<br><br>
<b><u>Riverton Investment Corp.</u></b>

<blockquote>Derek J. Nicholls ............... plant manager<br> 
Bruce B. Springer ............... director of safety <br> 
Daniel B. Lowe ............... safety manager<br> 
